{{> Start this}}

{{> Logo this}}

{{!--
  A sign-in link for an account (Types/Accounts/MagicLink), sent when
  somebody asks for one with this address on the sign-in page - which may
  not have been its owner, so the closing note says what happens if it is
  ignored. The link stands in for the password only: an account with two
  factor authentication still gives its second factor after opening it.
--}}

{{> EmailTitle title=(concat "Sign in to " (brandName)) }}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat "Use the button below to sign in to " (brandName) ". You don't need your password. If your account uses two factor authentication, you will still be asked for your code.")}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=tokenVerifyUrl buttonText="Sign In"}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=tokenVerifyUrl linkLabel="Or copy and paste this link into your browser:"}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat "The link works once and expires in " expiresInMinutes " minutes. Asking for another link replaces this one.")}}

{{!--
  Where the request came from (Partials/RequestOriginFields.hbs). Anybody
  who knows an address can ask for its link, so this is how the owner tells
  their own request from a stranger's.
--}}
{{#if requestedAt}}
{{> InfoBlock info="Details of the request:"}}

{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Requested at:" plainText=requestedAt }}
{{> RequestOriginFields this }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}
{{/if}}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo="If you didn't ask to sign in, you can safely ignore this email. Nobody can sign in with it unless the link above is used."}}

{{> SupportBlock this }}

{{> Footer this}}

{{> End this}}
